    "about": [
      "Two sides, two worlds. “Oi geitonies tou feggariou” gathers earlier songs in the voice of Flery Dadonaki. “Chorion o Pothos” (Op. 34, 1977) is a new cycle, to lyrics by Agathi Dimitrouka, Minos Argyrakis and himself, sung by the Cypriot Eftychios Chatzittofis. Cover by Giorgos Stathopoulos."
